    "description": "<p>Cyber Cost: 2</p><p>Once per long rest, when you mark your last Hit Point and would make a Death Move, take the Avoid Death Death Move. You fall unconscious, can’t move, act, or be targeted by attacks, and wake when an ally clears 1 or more of your marked Hit Points or when the party finishes a long rest. When you wake, roll your Hope Die. If the result is equal to or lower than your level, you gain a Scar.</p>",
